Ask explains PR code and nothing else (ADR 0007, ADR 0031). Keep every gate in `src/agent/ask/`: `classifyAskQuestionIntent` returns `bot_meta` and `askRun.ts` answers `ASK_META_REFUSAL` before any model session; `createAskPathGate` admits a `SENSITIVE_PATH_PATTERNS` path only when it is a PR-changed file or the code anchor; `buildAskRunSetup` exposes the workspace only via `hideWorkspaceToolsBehindCodeMode(buildLocalWorkspaceTools(...))`, so ask has no GitHub read tool; `sanitizeAskAnswerText` runs `redactOutboundSecrets` before posting. `askUserContent.ts` wraps `user_question`, `thread_transcript`, `code_anchor`, and `ci_state` with `wrapUntrustedBlock`. Intake calls `admitAsk` before the row insert. Ask is unleased: `askExecutor.ts` proves delivery only from a completed `ask_reply` publish record or `findExistingAskReplyComment`, and `outcome_unknown` is not delivery. Do not add severity changes, dismissals, or summary edits to ask. Guard: `test/askExecutor.test.ts`.
